  "notes": [
    "Nuvio KE content filter packs (Spec 117). A title is hidden when any enabled pack matches it.",
    "Words match whole words, upper or lower case, in a title's name, other titles and description; phrases match word by word. Hyphens, apostrophes and spaces all separate words.",
    "words: text and inside TMDB keyword names. textOnlyWords: text only. tagOnlyWords: inside TMDB keyword names only. wholeTagWords: only a TMDB keyword with exactly that name. Any word also matches a TMDB keyword whose whole name is that word.",
    "genreIds are TMDB genre ids; genreNames match addon genres by whole name. keywords are TMDB keywords: matched by id, the name is what the pack's page shows. adult: TMDB's adult flag. japaneseAnimation: TMDB Animation with original language Japanese.",
    "allowTitles: titles the pack never hides (TMDB movie or tv id).",
    "Limits: text in scripts without spaces (Chinese, Japanese, Thai) is one word, so a word in those scripts matches only a whole run; plurals and accents are not folded, so plural forms are listed.",
    "TMDB keywords need a TMDB key; without one, genres and words still apply. This product uses the TMDB API but is not endorsed or certified by TMDB."
